{"steam_appid":2497920,"steam_name":"A Difficult Game About Climbing","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2497920/774184/f06c3ad13125ad0d6e60603d6dd5eab88b1dde16/1750815896/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1729297846","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257066631/be3735a3f7188f0ee8386241a6448b92c5e89231/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1729297846","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/ss_726726f24961c07eb993bd61a040601d1b51e5a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766018522","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/ss_6f00ad40b91efec90eeffb010384c9f45c1c0584.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766018522","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/51c301d2afc30522aa692447f9a3aa6aebdf489f/ss_51c301d2afc30522aa692447f9a3aa6aebdf489f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766018522","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/ss_076a3ac1606659d6a0b78b956d07ac763aa82c44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766018522","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/ss_d3e56c4e9b2b4176ff5c059166b2cfd32da873a9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766018522"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REACH THE PEAK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull yourself up a treacherous mountain to reach the legendary <strong>Peak</strong><i>, </i>where eternal glory and a wonderful gift awaits. This journey demands complete mastery in the legendary art of climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game includes one free expansion</u></strong>, a completely new, bigger adventure featuring a full second chapter that’s more brutal, more ambitious, and absolutely not easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/e5e8b71f84899f01771065639b0f95c2.poster.avif?t=1766018522\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/e5e8b71f84899f01771065639b0f95c2.webm?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/e5e8b71f84899f01771065639b0f95c2.mp4?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deaths or violence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just the constant fear of falling and losing all your progress. Perhaps that is worse…</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics based climbing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use only your mouse to control the arms of the climber. Gamepad supported.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless suffering.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world record is under 4 minutes. You, however, will be here for hours. Possibly forever.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But not:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legs... You cannot use your legs for some reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/d9127771d719f6e49624631b00b61e4a.poster.avif?t=1766018522\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/d9127771d719f6e49624631b00b61e4a.webm?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/d9127771d719f6e49624631b00b61e4a.mp4?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAILURE IS A TEACHER. EACH FALL IS A LESSON.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a philosophical journey, uncover lessons of ancient wisdom and who knows... perhaps even the meaning of life itself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/923b995d9469cabbcae0936a5ed64fe2.poster.avif?t=1766018522\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/923b995d9469cabbcae0936a5ed64fe2.webm?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/923b995d9469cabbcae0936a5ed64fe2.mp4?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ETERNAL GLORY AWAITS YOU AT THE PEAK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer each of the 7 uniquely designed areas that make up this one colossal mountain to receive the grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expansion - Chapter 2:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely new, bigger adventure featuring a full second chapter that’s more brutal, more ambitious, and absolutely not easier. Adds 9 completely new zones and is included with the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/52b778636b26b843a937686d29702219.poster.avif?t=1766018522\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/52b778636b26b843a937686d29702219.webm?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497920/extras/52b778636b26b843a937686d29702219.mp4?t=1766018522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The ascent has become familiar… almost comforting. But alas, far below, within the endless water that binds earth to heaven, lies a glimmer of hope - and perhaps a deeper truth.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot;, itself a homage to an older game made by Jazzuo. I aimed to capture the magic of GOI's intensely difficult gameplay, which becomes comically easy once you master it.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 970/Radeon RX470 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"developers":["Pontypants"],"publishers":["Pontypants"],"release_date":"6 Mar, 2024"}